      "file": "audio/01k-classroom-2.mp3",
      "at": 3.4,
      "type": "voice",
      "duration": 2.8,
      "who": "dalia_teacher",
      "text": "שאלה מצוינת. בואי נחשוב."
    },
    {
      "file": "audio/narration/shira/01k-classroom-1.mp3",
      "at": 6.5,
      "type": "narration",
      "duration": 17.28,
      "text": "I was six. Dalia was explaining something about cows and water, and it didn't add up. So I screamed... [shouting] WHY? [beat] I wasn't scared. [firmly] In Israel, people aren't afraid to speak up when something isn't right. [warmly] We call it chutzpah.",
      "pause_after": 0.3,
      "path": "shira"
    }
  ],
